  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2018-11-26T05:10:15.849Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "With the unity 2017 update, importing alembic animation is now possible and it would be nice to be able to import drawings, animations, and perhaps cached fluids into our worlds. Thing is, alembic animations work with components that don't seem to work with VRChat worlds, at least not in the current beta.\n\nI would personally be using it to create a world(s) with a gallery of animations made with AnimVR or so.\n\nTool I would be using to import alembic files into unity: https://github.com/unity3d-jp/AlembicForUnity",
